# 9. Tree Traversal

Know the order **exactly**.

### Preorder
```text
Root → Left → Right
```

### Inorder
```text
Left → Root → Right
```

### Postorder
```text
Left → Right → Root
```

### Level-order
```text
Level by level
```

- [ ] Be able to perform each traversal on a given tree
- [ ] Know which data structure is commonly used:
  - DFS → stack / recursion
  - BFS / level-order → queue

